Example data in data/balruddery_2019.rda

Contains data supplied by UK Centre for Ecology & Hydrology.

Stanley et al. (2026), Daily and sub-daily hydrometeorological and soil
moisture data (2013-2025) [COSMOS-UK]. NERC EDS Environmental Information
Data Centre. https://doi.org/10.5285/dde10e2b-ee1a-4b2b-a247-176db2f7bb31

Licence: Open Government Licence v3. https://eidc.ac.uk/licences/ogl/plain

The extract contains all 365 records for the Balruddery station (BALRD) in
2019. The DATE_TIME and COSMOS_VWC columns were renamed date and vwc. The
water content values, expressed as percentages, are unchanged.

Source CSV retrieved on 22 November 2026:
https://catalogue.ceh.ac.uk/datastore/eidchub/dde10e2b-ee1a-4b2b-a247-176db2f7bb31/cosmos-uk_balrd_hydrosoil_daily_2014-2025.csv
